{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-192972-r4506783","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Deep Fried Chiles Stuffed with Potato (Mirchi Bada)","sourcePageId":192972,"sourceRevision":"4506783","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-11T03:02:47Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Deep%20Fried%20Chiles%20Stuffed%20with%20Potato%20(Mirchi%20Bada)&oldid=4506783","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:41:34.045Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Appetizer recipes","Category:Deep fried recipes","Category:Indian recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using chaat masala","Category:Recipes using chickpea flour","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using cilantro","Category:Recipes using potato","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"50e322f87c49b4f0fe27073e909d70fd3138af379fb22cc721e4f010b2bb2344","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Fritter recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n| Image = [[File:Mirchi Bada 2.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n__NOTOC__\n\n'''Mirchi bada''' is a popular Indian snack.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* Large green [[Cookbook:Chiles|chiles]]\n\n===Filling===\n* 3 large [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] red [[Cookbook:Chile|chile]] powder\n* [[Cookbook:Chaat Masala|Chaat masala]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Cilantro|coriander leaves]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] fine \n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste \n\n=== Batter ===\n* 1 cup [[Cookbook:Chickpea Flour|gram flour]] (besan) \n* 2 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinches]] [[Cookbook:Turmeric|turmeric]] powder \n* Salt to taste \n* Water as required \n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Slit the chiles, remove seeds, and set aside. \n# Boil potatoes in salted water. Peel and mash them well. Add chili powder, chaat masala, and coriander leaves. Mix well. \n# Make a thick [[Cookbook:Batter|batter]] with the flour, water, turmeric powder and salt. \n# Fill the chiles with the potato mix. Dip the filled chiles in the batter so they are completely covered.\n# [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|Deep fry]] the battered chiles in preheated oil until they turn golden brown.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Indian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chaat masala]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chickpea flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cilantro]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Deep Fried Chiles Stuffed with Potato (Mirchi Bada)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Large green chiles","sourceText":"Large green chiles","amountText":"Large green chiles","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 large potatoes","sourceText":"3 large potatoes","amountText":"3 large potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp red chile powder","sourceText":"1 tsp red chile powder","amountText":"1 tsp red chile powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Chaat masala","sourceText":"Chaat masala","a